// Signing for the Midgard macOS app and its test targets. [DD-6] [FR-C-9]
//
// With no team (the default, and every machine without the owner's Apple account):
// builds are signed ad hoc ("Sign to Run Locally", identity "-") with
// MidgardMac-AdHoc.entitlements, which leaves out keychain-access-groups: that is a
// restricted entitlement, and an ad-hoc app claiming it is killed at launch. Debug
// builds and their tests run; outside UI testing such a build cannot use the
// data-protection keychain and shows "cannot keep keys".
//
// With a team: create Config/Signing.local.xcconfig beside this file (gitignored, never
// committed) holding the one line
//
//     MIDGARD_TEAM_ID = XXXXXXXXXX
//
// and nothing else changes: signing becomes automatic under that team with the
// "Apple Development" identity and MidgardMac.entitlements (App Sandbox, no network,
// keychain-access-groups = $(AppIdentifierPrefix)io.veldris.midgard.mac, which the
// Secure Enclave key root needs). Xcode then needs the team's account signed in.
//
// How: MIDGARD_NO_TEAM is YES only while MIDGARD_TEAM_ID is empty, because
// MIDGARD_NO_TEAM_$(MIDGARD_TEAM_ID) then names MIDGARD_NO_TEAM_ (defined below) and,
// with a team, a setting nobody defines (empty). The identity and the entitlements
// are looked up by that YES-or-empty value. Never list Signing.local.xcconfig in
// project.yml's configFiles: it is optional, and absent on a fresh checkout.

MIDGARD_TEAM_ID =

MIDGARD_NO_TEAM_ = YES
MIDGARD_NO_TEAM = $(MIDGARD_NO_TEAM_$(MIDGARD_TEAM_ID))

CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = $(MIDGARD_TEAM_ID)

MIDGARD_IDENTITY_YES = -
MIDGARD_IDENTITY_ = Apple Development
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = $(MIDGARD_IDENTITY_$(MIDGARD_NO_TEAM))

// The app target sets CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = $(MIDGARD_MAC_ENTITLEMENTS); the test
// targets have no entitlements of their own.
MIDGARD_ENTITLEMENTS_YES = Config/MidgardMac-AdHoc.entitlements
MIDGARD_ENTITLEMENTS_ = Config/MidgardMac.entitlements
MIDGARD_MAC_ENTITLEMENTS = $(MIDGARD_ENTITLEMENTS_$(MIDGARD_NO_TEAM))

#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
